/**
  @page msi Windows Deploy

you can deploy the editor on Windows using Visual Studio IDE 2022(with msi):

Need to install: 
"Microsoft Visual Studio Installer Projects 2022"
that will enable IDE to modify "SetupTazGraph" project, which is responsible
for creating the .msi and its .exe files.

Right-click on Project->Build while configuration is "Release"
Some dlls may break the app, but they should be already cleaned and handled (like OPENGL.dll or IMM32.dll)

*/
